        "english_name": "English",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Set ten years after the events of the first film, the story explores the impact of time on institutions, relationships, and individuals, delivering a poignant yet inspiring tale about the invisible costs of pursuing one's dreams.",
          "runtime": 126,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "NL",
        "iso_639_1": "nl",
        "name": "Nederlands",
        "english_name": "Dutch",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Het verhaal speelt zich tien jaar na de gebeurtenissen in de eerste film af en onderzoekt de impact van tijd op instellingen, relaties en individuen, en levert een aangrijpend maar inspirerend verhaal op over de onzichtbare kosten van het najagen van je dromen.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "CN",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "一场法学院昔日好友的重聚因一个噩耗而变得喜忧参半——他们得知一位深受敬爱的恩师已身患绝症，不仅孤苦伶仃，还遭到了家人的抛弃。为了守护恩师，这群早已步入社会的律政精英与新一代在校法学生联起手来，主动承担起家人的责任，在陪伴与照顾中实现了信念与情谊的传承。",
          "runtime": 129,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "律政男孩：课后时分"
        }
      }
    ]
